        "@value": "in paragraph (a), by substituting for the words “pass or honours degree” the word “degree”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/1/eng@/~cl_7__para_d__subpara_ii",
